,"vndbCharacterId":"c79539"},"originalCharacterName":"篠原 智美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was born with both female and male genitalia. She was unaware of this when she was a child, but from the time she entered elementary school, she began to realize that her body was different from that of a normal human being."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hurt by the curious eyes and lack of understanding of those around her, she gradually began to retreat into her own shell, avoiding contact with those around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her family is the only place she can open up to, and Yoshiki is especially special to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tomomi is quiet and withdrawn, but she shows her mischievous side by being selfish and sulking only to Yoshiki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very considerate of others. She keeps her worries bottled up inside and forces herself to laugh. She is a bit of a recluse and sometimes doesn't go to school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a type of person who does things systematically and steadily. The protagonist is the only person with whom she can express her selfishness and complaints, and she is thoroughly spoiled by the main character"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From archived official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c79539"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"芳樹の義理の妹。光陽学園１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性器と男性器とを持ち合わせる「半陰陽」に生まれつく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃は特にそれを意識していなかったが、小学校に入学した頃から自分の肉体が普通の人間と違うことを知るようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲の好奇の目と無理解に傷つけられ、やがて徐々に周囲とのふれあいを避け自分の殻に閉じこもる様になっていった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな智美にとって唯一心を開けるのが家族であり、特に兄は特別な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしい性格で引っ込み思案だが、兄にだけはわがままを言ったりすねてみたりと茶目っ気のあるところを見せる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26910","sourceWorkId":"4522","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"家族構成：養父 ／ 母 ／ 義兄"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"職業：学生（文芸部所属）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな食べ物：グミ（新製品は必ずチェック）／主人公が作るオムレツ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌いな食べ物：こんにゃく"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"得意な学科：現代文・古典"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦手な学科：体育（常に見学）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな人：主人公"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌いな人：特にないが、他人との触れあいを避けがち"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好きな物：子犬／静かな場所"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦手な物：運動／機械（携帯・パソコン・録画予約など）／カラオケ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：読書"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格："},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・おとなしく内気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・かなり他人に気を使う。悩みなどは内側にため込んで無理に笑うタイプ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・引きこもり気味で、学校にも登校しないことがたまにある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・ものごとは計画的にコツコツやるタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"・主人公には我が侭や不平を言える唯一の相手として徹底的に甘える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芳樹の1歳違いの義理の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔陽学園１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性器と男性器とを持ち合わせる「半陰陽」に生まれつく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃は特にそれを意識していなかったが、 小学校に入学した頃から自分の肉体が普通の 人間と違うことを知るようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲の好奇の目と無理解に傷つけられ、やがて徐々に周囲とのふれあいを避け自分の殻に閉じこもるようになっていった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな智美にとって唯一心を開けるのが家族であり、 特に芳樹は特別な存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おとなしい性格で引っ込み思案だが、芳樹にだけは わがままを言ったりすねてみたりと茶目っ気の あるところを見せる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200141"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26910","sourceWorkId":"4522","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"154 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26910"